OL,3,GNEWSANotting Hill Carnival revels in
OL,4,A60th anniversary celebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FNotting Hill Carnival has celebrated
OL,7,Fits 60th anniversary with three days of
OL,8,Frevelry fuelled by drummers, dancers
OL,9,Fand colourful costumes.
OL,11,FEurope's biggest street party continued
OL,12,Fon Monday with the adults' parade, live
OL,13,Fbands, more than 30 static sound
OL,14,Fsystems and the scent of jerk chicken
OL,15,Ffloating through the air.
OL,17,FThe carnival, which celebrates
OL,18,FCaribbean culture and history, was
OL,19,Ffirst held in west London in 1966.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
